	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Obsecro te, clarissime et charissime d. compater, ut mei <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sis memor in declarandis ministris verbi Christi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Meam nosti miseriam <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>inprimis in re frumentaria cum tot pueris, et cum nihil nunc <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>spei relictum sit cum <placeName ref="l1057">Thälliken</placeName>, optarem proficisci in <placeName ref="l2750">Steinmur</placeName> et optimo <lb xml:id="p1z5"/><persName>Hilero</persName> succesorem agere in ecclesiastico officio.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Esset locus familię <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>meę plane oportunus ad alendam eam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">In locum meum potest alterius boni fratris fieri electio, cum non t<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>am numerosa esset soboles etc.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Da mihi in electione nomen et vocem tuam sanctam; nam magnę energię es<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>t, et vivet anima mea et in te et domino meo Christo.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Is curam tui habeat, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>precor ex animo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale foeliciter.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Ex <placeName ref="l362">Oberglatt</placeName> 18. maii anno 62.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/><persName ref="p8130">Laurentius</persName> semper tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>P<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>r<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>raestantissimo dei ministro d. <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Heinri[co] Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesię <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> pastori circum<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>spectissimo, d. et compatri suo <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>plurimum observando etc.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
